id: seed-es-cats-040
Spanish: la bola de pelo
English: hairball
Gender / POS: f. noun
Example (ES): El gato vomitó una {{c1::bola de pelo}}.
Example (EN): The cat threw up a hairball.

id: seed-es-cats-041
Spanish: la transportadora
English: pet carrier
Gender / POS: f. noun
Example (ES): Mete al gato en la {{c1::transportadora}}.
Example (EN): Put the cat in the carrier.
Notes: Mexico: "la transportadora"; Spain: "el transportín".

id: seed-es-cats-042
Spanish: adoptar
English: to adopt
Gender / POS: verb
Example (ES): {{c1::Adoptamos}} a nuestro gato en un refugio.
Example (EN): We adopted our cat from a shelter.
Notes: Popular slogan: "Adopta, no compres" (Adopt, don't shop).

id: seed-es-cats-043
Spanish: atigrado
