id: seed-es-cats-046
Spanish: peludo
English: furry, hairy, fluffy
Gender / POS: adj.
Example (ES): Los gatos {{c1::peludos}} sueltan mucho pelo.
Example (EN): Fluffy cats shed a lot of hair.

id: seed-es-cats-047
Spanish: arisco
English: skittish, standoffish
Gender / POS: adj.
